From 71f2ff7ea5da597be88f7d787551b2f260c21397 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:18:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 14/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add HEVC stream-counter restart

Restart the HEVC core before its stream counter wraps and restore the
request context at a safe boundary. Require successful quiescence
before restarting. Restream VP9 keyframes at restart boundaries.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.0
